        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6. The Association agrees that if at any time during the term of this Contract the Association is guilty of authorizing, causing or engaging in, or sanctioning any strike or other illegal work stoppage of any kind, the privilege of dues deduction and collection previously granted may be revoked during the remainder of the term of this Contract, but not beyond the following June 30.",
